st like they did in 2011. the fmg9  only takes as little as three shots to  kill someone  or two if you land headshots why the  g18s and  fmg9s are in modern warfare 3 is a weird  one besides the collapsible body they're  the same gun  style points i guess regardless if you  were near someone using the fmg9s turn  around and run  because you will be deleted  the model 1887s these guns were from a  time in call of duty some would call the  golden years  if you were like me you were curious  after getting killed by them millions of  times  you finally unlock a single model 1887  at level 67.  please what harm can i really do with  these you say as you reluctantly build a  class  the match starts and you're scared  shotguns don't have the best range  i should take cover you spot someone  with their back turn  now's your chance you waste the poor  fool and it feels like a door  unlocked your heart gets warm and you  realize why people are drawn to this  silly 100 year old gun  the 1887 was a mess its damage and range  were embarrassingly good  and that's only when you used one of  them without question  the best way to use the 1887 was going  akimbo  i still have very vivid memories of  getting blasted in the alleyways of  favela with these things  and you know what these memories grow  fonder the older i get  we need broken guns in call of duty  games even if for a while before the  inevitable patch  making this list took me down a fun  nostalgic road of call of duty's past  so please continue to share your  favorite broken guns in the comments  what i miss the 725s the intervention  the brekkie  i want to hear them all call of duty  black ops cold war is coming our way  soon  so be sure to subscribe to stick around  for full coverage and  ps5 gameplay thanks for watching  you

